{"assets":["/statement-assets/20bcc795a76cad262bd796aaed46bb23333f9fb800bb7ace4b7e70f9c5c1f9cf.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1209","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Koala and Lights"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is a holiday season, and Koala is decorating his house with cool lights! He owns $$$n$$$ lights, all of which flash periodically."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After taking a quick glance at them, Koala realizes that each of his lights can be described with two parameters $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$. Light with parameters $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$ will toggle (on to off, or off to on) every $$$a_i$$$ seconds starting from the $$$b_i$$$-th second. In other words, it will toggle at the moments $$$b_i$$$, $$$b_i + a_i$$$, $$$b_i + 2 \\cdot a_i$$$ and so on."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You know for each light whether it's initially on or off and its corresponding parameters $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$. Koala is wondering what is the maximum number of lights that will ever be on at the same time. So you need to find that out."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/20bcc795a76cad262bd796aaed46bb23333f9fb800bb7ace4b7e70f9c5c1f9cf.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here is a graphic for the first example."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 100$$$), the number of lights."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains a string $$$s$$$ of $$$n$$$ characters. The $$$i$$$-th character is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", if the $$$i$$$-th lamp is initially on. Otherwise, $$$i$$$-th character is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the following $$$n$$$ lines contains two integers $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i, b_i \\le 5$$$)  — the parameters of the $$$i$$$-th light."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the maximum number of lights that will ever be on at the same time."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n101\n3 3\n3 2\n3 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n1111\n3 4\n5 2\n3 1\n3 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n011100\n5 3\n5 5\n2 4\n3 5\n4 2\n1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For first example, the lamps' states are shown in the picture above. The largest number of simultaneously on lamps is $$$2$$$ (e.g. at the moment $$$2$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, all lights are initially on. So the answer is $$$4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1209B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1209/problem/B"}